Recommends: python3-pyqt6.qtpdf
Description: Modern comic editor compatible with legacy TBO documents
 TBO is a comic and cartoon editor. This is the Python/PyQt6
 reimplementation of the original GNOME application.
 .
 It reads and writes the legacy .tbo format, offers an interactive canvas with
 pages and panels, supports text, image and SVG objects, provides a library of
 doodles and speech bubbles, and exports to PNG, PDF and SVG.
